Hand written, applies after the generated rename (0100) and uses the final names.
The image's own GRUB gets the extra kernel arguments (console) of OTAPULSE_GRUB_KERNEL_BOOT_ARGS plus
panic=N as a drop-in; the Debian arm64 target sets the boot partition size and the serial console;
the empty demo overlay directory placeholder goes.

